          "special": {
            "value": "You can't select another dedication feat until you've gained two other feats from the Golden League Xun archetype.\nLeads to: Beneath Notice|FRP2, Menacing Prowess|FRP2, Rope Mastery|FRP2, Silent Sting|FRP2"
